  "content": "<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252f4wkDVG6h\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ym2MQ1wH/meccha-crafteleon-title.png\" alt=\"機械變色龍工藝\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-加入我們-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f4704690%252fMECCHA_CHAMELEON%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/原始遊戲-機械變色龍-navy?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=steam&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"原始遊戲：機械變色龍\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/meccha-crafteleon-together\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/模組包-機械變色龍工藝一起玩-F16436?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"模組包：機械變色龍工藝一起玩\">\n🌍 <strong>公開伺服器：</strong> <code>5.196.90.238:25570</code> (MC 1.21.11)\n<blockquote>\n  塗上顏色，融入環境。\n</blockquote>\n機械變色龍工藝將遊戲 <strong>機械變色龍</strong> 帶入 Minecraft。\n穿上變色龍盔甲，將白色身體塗成與房間相符的顏色，擺個姿勢，然後靜止不動。\n如同機械變色龍，你因被看見而得分。在眾目睽睽之下隱藏！\n找幾個朋友，塗上顏色，看看誰有最敏銳的偽裝觀察力 :)\n<em>由 <strong>lemorion_1224</strong> 製作的機械變色龍粉絲致敬作品，非官方關聯。</em></a><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f4704690%252fMECCHA_CHAMELEON%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">快去玩原始遊戲吧！</a></em><h2>操作方式</h2><code>/meccha</code><h2>畫廊</h2><table>\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fZRNfF6Hv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Q7XJTF8h/supports-shaders.png\" alt=\"支援光影模組！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fbMx6gZvM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nNTwsv1N/meccha-gravel.png\" alt=\"我是一塊礫石！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fyC3LhG2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/XPwmyNH/meccha-sunset.png\" alt=\"喔～好美的日落！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fTB0Htjq8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z6ghx418/screen-meccha2.png\" alt=\"我們可以疊在一起爬上去！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><table>\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fKjN9BVLF\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xSmMwzfJ/meccha-inventory.png\" alt=\"機械變色龍物品欄\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fdwwkdphZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nNNQH1Wp/meccha-armors.png\" alt=\"機械變色龍盔甲\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fYB5t9NDZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZzQhsfHm/meccha-armor-upgrade.png\" alt=\"機械變色龍盔甲升級\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><blockquote>\n  <strong>測試版：仍在開發中。</strong> 機械變色龍工藝正在積極開發中，並將頻繁更新。目前已有<strong>完整的可玩內容</strong>（塗色、姿勢、房間、捉迷藏）。未來版本將加入更多功能與完善，歡迎回報任何不完善之處。\n</blockquote><em>致謝：變色龍散彈槍的 3D 模型與材質由 <strong>ECYsh364</strong> 製作（來自 GWR3D 資源包）。</em><hr><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-加入我們-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252faminoquiz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/贊助-Ko--fi-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"贊助\"></a><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入 Discord</a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252faminoquiz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ko-fi.com/aminoquiz</a><strong>1.49 美元/月</strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252famine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">我們